{"title": "Delhi High Court Orders Restoration of Cockroach Janta Party's Social Media Account", "summary": "The Delhi High Court has ordered the restoration of Cockroach Janta Party's social media account, revoking the Centre's blocking order. The court's decision comes after a petition was filed by party leader Abhijit Dipak on behalf of his client, who is a member of the party. The court's ruling is seen as a victory for free speech and the right to express dissenting views.", "summary_points": ["The Delhi High Court has ordered the restoration of Cockroach Janta Party's social media account.", "The court revoked the Centre's blocking order, which had been in place since February this year.", "The decision comes after a petition was filed by party leader Abhijit Dipak on behalf of his client, who is a member of the party.", "The court's ruling is seen as a victory for free speech and the right to express dissenting views."], "title_hi": "दिल्ली हाईकोर्ट ने कॉकरोच जनता पार्टी के सोशल मीडिया अकाउंट को बहाल करने का आदेश दिया", "summary_hi": "दिल्ली हाईकोर्ट ने कॉकरोच जनता पार्टी के सोशल मीडिया अकाउंट को बहाल करने का आदेश दिया, जिसने केंद्र सरकार के अकाउंट ब्लॉक करने के आदेश को रद्द कर दिया।", "summary_points_hi": ["दिल्ली हाईकोर्ट ने कॉकरोच जनता पार्टी के सोशल मीडिया अकाउंट को बहाल करने का आदेश दिया।", "कोर्ट ने केंद्र सरकार के अकाउंट ब्लॉक करने के आदेश को रद्द कर दिया।", "पार्टी के नेता अभिजीत दिपक के प्रति एक याचिका दायर की गई थी।", "कोर्ट का फैसला स्वतंत्र विचार और विरोध के अधिकार के लिए एक जीत माना जा रहा है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the court's decision as a victory for free speech and the right to express dissenting views. They also highlight the Centre's blocking order as an attempt to suppress opposition voices.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a judicial intervention in a social media dispute, with no explicit emphasis on free speech or politics. However, some outlets note that the court's decision may have implications for the functioning of social media platforms in India."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी संगठनों को यह फैसला स्वतंत्र विचार और विरोध के अधिकार के लिए एक जीत मानते हैं। वे केंद्र सरकार द्वारा अकाउंट ब्लॉक करने के आदेश को विरोधी आवाजों को दबाने का प्रयास बताते हैं।", "center": "केंद्रित समाचार इस मामले को एक न्यायिक अंतर्दृष्टि के रूप में प्रस्तुत करते हैं, जिसमें सोशल मीडिया विवाद की बातचीत शामिल है। हालांकि, कुछ संगठनों ने यह उल्लेख किया है कि अदालत का फैसला भारत में सोशल मीडिया प्लेटफार्मों के कार्यान्वयन पर प्रभाव डाल सकता है।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/07/07/1600x900/logo/Cockroach_Janta_Party_logo_1783409459155_1783409459310_5c7a27e7-2a63-4d68-989b-f6a2c7b3c7c6.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Mint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/delhi-hc-directs-restoration-of-cockroach-janta-partys-x-account-revokes-centres-order-11783408375309.html", "headline": "Delhi HC directs restoration of Cockroach Janta Party's X account, revokes Centre's order"}, {"source": "Scroll.in", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Delhi HC orders unblocking of Cockroach Janta Party’s X account"}, {"source": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/video/india-news/relief-for-cjp-from-high-court-order-issued-to-restore-x-account-2026-07-07", "headline": "CJP को हाईकोर्ट से राहत: X अकाउंट बहाल करने का दिया आदेश"}, {"source": "The Quint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Delhi High Court Restores Cockroach Janta Party X Account After NEET Exam"}, {"source": "LiveLaw", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "BREAKING| Delhi High Court Orders Unblocking Of 'Cockroach Janata Party's X Account"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "ht